<title>HONG KONG: Bank of China to set HK$2 bln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank of China to set HK$2 bln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of China has mandated China Development Finance Co to arrange a HK$2 billion floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They said the facility had a final maturity of five years with no put or call options.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
